  "content": "\n\n<h1>擴展游標</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/default.png\" alt=\"預設\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/pointing_hand.png\" alt=\"指標\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/grabbing.png\" alt=\"抓取\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/ibeam.png\" alt=\"I 型光束\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/shift.png\" alt=\"移動\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/busy.gif\" alt=\"忙碌\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/not_allowed.png\" alt=\"不允許\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/crosshair.png\" alt=\"十字準線\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_all.png\" alt=\"全方向調整大小\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_ew.png\" alt=\"左右調整大小\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_ns.png\" alt=\"上下調整大小\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_nwse.png\" alt=\"左上至右下調整大小\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_nesw.png\" alt=\"右上至左下調整大小\"></p>\n<p>將無聊的舊版系統預設游標替換為 Minecraft 風格的游標。</p>\n<p>在 1.21.9 引入大量破壞性變更之前，本模組曾名為 <a href=\"https://github.com/fishstiz/minecraft-cursor/blob/master/README.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Cursor</a>。</p>\n<h2>📌 需求</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fabric 平台：Fabric API</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>✨ 功能</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用資源包自訂游標紋理。</li>\n<li>透過自訂動畫讓游標活起來。</li>\n<li>內建適合其他情境的額外游標形狀。</li>\n<li>透過 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffishstiz.github.io%252fminecraft-cursor-wiki%252fresource-pack%252fgetting-started%2523all-cursors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>傳統模式</strong></a>，為各種 GUI 元素增強游標邏輯。</li>\n<li>可依個人喜好調整多項選項。請前往模組選單，或依序開啟 選項 › 控制 › 滑鼠設定 › 游標設定。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1338/150/cursors_extended-gif.gif\" alt=\"擴展游標\"></p>\n<h2>🖌️ 建立資源包</h2>\n<p>製作屬於自己的資源包，分享至支援的平台，並讓它在此 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffishstiz.github.io%252fcursors_extended-wiki%252fresource-pack%252fshowcase\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">展示</a>！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffishstiz.github.io%252fcursors_extended-wiki%252fresource-pack%252fshowcase\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fishstiz/resources/refs/heads/main/cursors-extended/showcase.gif\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"展示\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/bedrock-style-cursors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/dUA5FyFq/images/28f9504fa044c59491a1555494b3e579eec186a1.png\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"基岩版風格游標\">\n</a></p>\n<hr>\n<p>已經為 Minecraft Cursor v3 製作過資源包了嗎？請使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffishstiz.github.io%252fcursors_extended-wiki%252ftools%252f%2523v3-converter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>V3 轉換器</strong></a> 進行轉換。</p>\n<p>開始使用： <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffishstiz.github.io%252fcursors_extended-wiki%252fresource-pack%252fgetting-started\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/resource-pack/getting-started</a></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
